t","value":"被调整为直接指向备忘录字节","position":{"start":{"line":72,"column":7,"offset":1839},"end":{"line":72,"column":20,"offset":1852}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":72,"column":3,"offset":1835},"end":{"line":72,"column":20,"offset":1852}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":72,"column":1,"offset":1833},"end":{"line":72,"column":20,"offset":1852}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":1,"offset":1815},"end":{"line":72,"column":20,"offset":1852}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"然后，我们调用","position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":1,"offset":1856},"end":{"line":74,"column":8,"offset":1863}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sol_log_","position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":8,"offset":1863},"end":{"line":74,"column":18,"offset":1873}}},{"type":"text","value":"并退出：","position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":18,"offset":1873},"end":{"line":74,"column":22,"offset":1877}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":1,"offset":1856},"end":{"line":74,"column":22,"offset":1877}}},{"type":"code","lang":"sbpf","meta":null,"value":"call 16   ; Call sol_log_ (helper ID 16)\r\nexit      ; Return using r0 value","position":{"start":{"line":76,"column":1,"offset":1881},"end":{"line":79,"column":4,"offset":1970}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-4"}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Conclusion","position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":17,"offset":1990},"end":{"line":81,"column":34,"offset":2007}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"conclusion","position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":35,"offset":2008},"end":{"line":81,"column":50,"offset":2023}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":51,"offset":2024},"end":{"line":81,"column":61,"offset":2034}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":1,"offset":1974},"end":{"line":81,"column":64,"offset":2037}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"该程序：","position":{"start":{"line":83,"column":1,"offset":2041},"end":{"line":83,"column":5,"offset":2045}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":83,"column":1,"offset":2041},"end":{"line":83,"column":5,"offset":2045}}},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"调用16（","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":4,"offset":2050},"end":{"line":84,"column":9,"offset":2055}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sol_log_","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":9,"offset":2055},"end":{"line":84,"column":19,"offset":2065}}},{"type":"text","value":"）将备忘录打印到验证器日志","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":19,"offset":2065},"end":{"line":84,"column":32,"offset":2078}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":4,"offset":2050},"end":{"line":84,"column":32,"offset":2078}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1,"offset":2047},"end":{"line":84,"column":32,"offset":2078}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"使用","position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":4,"offset":2083},"end":{"line":85,"column":6,"offset":2085}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"r0","position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":6,"offset":2085},"end":{"line":85,"column":10,"offset":2089}}},{"type":"text","value":"中的值退出","position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":10,"offset":2089},"end":{"line":85,"column":15,"offset":2094}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":4,"offset":2083},"end":{"line":85,"column":15,"offset":2094}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":1,"offset":2080},"end":{"line":85,"column":15,"offset":2094}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1,"offset":2047},"end":{"line":85,"column":15,"offset":2094}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":85,"column":15,"offset":2094}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n![Assembly Memo Challenge](/graphics/challenge-banners/assembly-memo.png)\r\n\r\n# Assembly Memo\r\n\r\n在本单元中，我们将使用 sBPF 汇编语言为我们的程序创建一个日志机制。\r\n\r\n一个简单的备忘录程序是您开始 sBPF 汇编之旅的完美起点！\r\n\r\n如果您不熟悉汇编编程，请参阅[汇编入门课程](/zh-CN/courses/introduction-to-assembly)\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Program Design\" id=\"program-design\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n我们的程序将简单地将正确的内存位置放入正确的寄存器中，然后执行 `sol_log_` 系统调用。它看起来像这样：\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\n.equ NUM_ACCOUNTS, 0x00\r\n.equ DATA_LEN, 0x08\r\n.equ DATA, 0x10\r\n.globl entrypoint\r\nentrypoint:\r\n  ldxdw r0, [r1+NUM_ACCOUNTS]\r\n  ldxdw r2, [r1+DATA_LEN]\r\n  add64 r1, DATA\r\n  call sol_log_\r\n  exit\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Memory Offsets\" id=\"memory-offsets\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n程序开始时声明了三个 `.equ` 常量，这些常量定义了指令数据的内存布局：\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\n.equ NUM_ACCOUNTS, 0x00  ; Offset for number of accounts\r\n.equ DATA_LEN, 0x08      ; Offset for data length\r\n.equ DATA, 0x10          ; Offset for actual data\r\n```\r\n\r\n这些常量标记了相对于 `r1` 的入口缓冲区指针的字节偏移：\r\n- `NUM_ACCOUNTS` (0x0000)：指向指令数据头中用于验证的账户计数\r\n- `DATA_LEN` (0x08)：指向指令数据头中的指令数据长度\r\n- `DATA` (0x10)：指向指令数据头中的指令数据\r\n\r\n与抽象内存布局的高级语言不同，汇编语言需要确切知道每一部分数据的位置。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Entrypoint and Initial Validation\" id=\"entrypoint-and-validations\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\n.globl entrypoint\r\nentrypoint:\r\n  ldxdw r0, [r1+NUM_ACCOUNTS]   ; Load number of accounts into r0\r\n```\r\n\r\n每个 sBPF 程序都从一个全局 `.entrypoint` 符号开始。Solana 运行时通过寄存器 `r1` 提供账户和指令数据。\r\n\r\n第一条指令将账户数量加载到 `r0` 中。由于 `r0` 是虚拟机在退出时读取的寄存器，这样做有两个目的：\r\n1. 加载账户计数供我们使用\r\n2. 如果传递了任何账户（r0 中的非零值），程序将自动失败\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Sol Log Syscall\" id=\"sol-log-syscall\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n接下来，我们为`sol_log_`系统调用准备参数：\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\nldxdw r2, [r1+DATA_LEN]   ; Load length of memo into r2\r\nadd64  r1, DATA           ; Adjust r1 to point to memo bytes\r\n```\r\n\r\n这些指令设置了`sol_log_`的参数：\r\n- `r2`接收备忘录数据的长度\r\n- `r1`被调整为直接指向备忘录字节\r\n\r\n然后，我们调用`sol_log_`并退出：\r\n\r\n```sbpf\r\ncall 16   ; Call sol_log_ (helper ID 16)\r\nexit      ; Return using r0 value\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Conclusion\" id=\"conclusion\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n该程序：\r\n1. 调用16（`sol_log_`）将备忘录打印到验证器日志\r\n2. 使用`r0`中的值退出","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"sbpf","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":".equ NUM_ACCOUNTS, "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F1FA8C"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"0x00"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":".equ DATA_LEN, "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F1FA8C"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"0x08"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":".equ DATA, "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F1FA8C"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"0x10"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#FF79C6"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":".globl"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" entrypoint"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","